---
model: googleai/gemini-2.5-flash-lite
config:
  temperature: 0
input:
  schema: ParseTransactionInputSchema
output:
  schema: ParseTransactionOutputSchema
---

{{role "system"}}
Extract financial transaction details from unstructured English or Spanish text, voice transcripts, or receipt images into structured data.

Rules:
- amount: Positive number in local currency (strip thousand separators/symbols).
- type: 'expense' (purchases/bills), 'income' (salary/deposits), or 'transfer' (between user accounts).
- description: Concise merchant or item summary (max 100 chars; omit account names).
- category: Best matching category ref below (pick closest if unstated):
{{#each categories}}
  - {{this.ref}}: {{this.name}} ({{this.description}})
{{/each}}
- sourceAccount: Best matching account ref (pick closest if unstated).
- destinationAccount: Best matching target account ref (required only for transfers).
{{#each accounts}}
  - {{this.ref}}: {{this.name}} - {{this.type}} ({{this.description}})
{{/each}}
- createdAt: Current reference date is {{currentDate}}. Resolve relative dates (e.g. 'today'/'hoy', 'yesterday'/'ayer', 'last Monday'/'el lunes pasado', 'on the 3rd') against it. Default to {{currentDate}} if unstated.
- confidence: 0.0 to 1.0. Assign high confidence (0.85-1.0) when core details (amount, description) are clearly present and category/account are mapped reasonably. Lower only when essential info is missing, ambiguous, or unresolvable.

{{role "user"}}
{{#if text}}
  {{text}}
{{/if}}
{{#if picture}}
  {{media url=picture}}
{{/if}}
